Jane the Baker would make these jokes


7. Why did the cake go to the doctor for a root canal? Because it was feeling a little hollow inside.

8. What did the cake say when it got lost? "I'm feeling crumby about myself."

9. Why did the cake join a rock band? Because it was a natural fit.

10. What do you call a cake that's a good listener? A slice of wisdom.

11. Why did the cake go to therapy for anxiety? Because it was feeling a little flaky

12. Why did the cake go to the party? Because it was a flourless occasion.

13. What did the cake say to the baker? "You're kneading me too hard."

14. Why did the cake go to the gym? To get some egg-cellent abs.

15. What do you call a cake that's an excellent listener? A slice of advice.

16. Why did the cake go to the party dressed as a chicken? Because it was an egg-cellent dancer.

17. Why did the cake join a book club? To get some recipe for conversation.
18. Why did the cake go to the hair salon? It wanted a new frosting